<title>UK: John Lewis weekly UK store sales up 14.9% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>John Lewis weekly UK store sales up 14.9% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said on Friday its UK department store sales for the week to September 21 were up 14.9 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>For the eight weeks to September 21, department store sales were up 16.6 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>Total sales, including those from the Waitrose supermarket chain, rose 13.1 percent year-on-year. For the eight-week period, sales were up 13.0 percent.</p>
</text>
